Sample courses and module templates of elabora-core
---------------------------------------------------

The pictures and videos of public/media/exemples/ and public/media/modeles/, the dialogue of
public/demo/phishing/, the canal lock of src/demos/ecluse/, public/downloads/coffee-in-brief.elabora
and src/content/core-docs/docs/images/ show elabora-core's sample courses and templates. Their
original content is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). Each sample's LICENSE.md in elabora-core
lists what keeps its own licence; src/demos/ecluse/LICENSE-canal-locks.md is the lock's.

The pictures of medieval-charts show two medieval maps in the public domain: the Catalan Atlas
(1375, Bibliothèque nationale de France) and the Hereford Mappa Mundi (around 1300), via
Wikimedia Commons.

Narration of the dialogue
-------------------------

public/demo/phishing/narration/**/*.m4a are synthetic voices made with ElevenLabs (voice
« Kristen » of the ElevenLabs voice library) on a plan that allows commercial use. They follow
ElevenLabs' terms and stay outside CC0. The player shows their credit.

